alpacabridge (1.0.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Initial stable release of AlpacaBridge ASCOM Alpaca HTTP server.
  * Includes ZWO (ASI cameras, EAF focuser, EFW filter wheel, CAA rotator),
    QHY camera, iOptron mount, SynScan/Celestron mount, Gemini Automatic Astro
    Focuser Pro, and WeeWX weather support.
  * ZWO ASI Camera shared library packaging (libASICamera2.so).
  * ld.so.conf.d registration for vendor shared libraries.
  * Installs udev rules and QHY firmware for plug-and-play USB device access.
  * Adds dialout and input groups in postinst for USB device access.
  * Registers alpacabridge.service to start the server on each boot.

 -- Joey Troy <joey.troy@gmail.com>  Thu, 26 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000
